  "controls": [
    "Public TeamConnection.Observe receives a genuinely scoped TLS/authenticated snapshot using real native NATS and the private resolver.",
    "Public Probe performs real authenticated write/readback against the seeded health stream.",
    "Public Observe reads the actual stored record without write permissions.",
    "Precleanup recorder captures actual result and nil primary cause; it neither supplies nor changes facts.",
    "Only the actual observeDialer-minted TCP socket is wrapped before its cancellation hook is published. Its first concrete Close fails; retained typed error owns the exact recorded dialer.",
    "Returned facts are cleared, explicit bounded exact-owner retry is idempotent, raw socket write reports net.ErrClosed afterward, no owned socket/hook remains.",
    "Each independent omission of the caller fact reset fails the corresponding caller assertion."
  ],
